    "id": "departments-computer-science",
    "title": "Department of Computer Science and Engineering | UET RCET - University of Engineering and Technology, Gujranwala Campus",
    "href": "https://rcet.uet.edu.pk/departments/computer-science",
    "originalBody": "Introduction\nPrograms Offered\nFaculty\nLabs\nPLOs\nPEOs\nIntroduction\nThe department of Computer Science and Engineering was established in 2008 and is currently offering a degree course in Computer Science at undergraduate level. The mission of Computer Science and Engineering Department is to equip the students with up-to-date curricula of computer science and engineering disciplines, to ensure that the students have the solid foundations in the core concepts in computing and Engineering disciplines, to train them in problem solving and decision making skills and to prepare them for lifelong learning in the discipline. The department has qualified faculty comprising of three PhD faculty members and seven holds MPhil degree. In order to develop the qualified faculty, several teachers were provided financial grants to go abroad for postgraduate studies leading to Doctorate in computer science. The department introduced the 4 year B.Sc. in Computer Science in 2008. The B.Sc. Computer Science Program is accredited by National Computing and Accreditation Council (NCEAC).\nPrograms Offered\nB.Sc. Computer Science\nM.Sc. Computer Science\nProgram Learning Outcomes (PLOs)\n\nView our detailed Program Learning Outcomes\n\nProgram Educational Objectives (PEOs)\n\nView our detailed Program Educational Objectives\n\n\n\nChairman's Message\n\nI welcome you on the behalf of the Department of Computer Science and Engineering at RCET (Gujranwala Campus of UET Lahore). Computer Science and Information Technology Sector has the most potential job market due to the billion-dollar export mark of Pakistan. Our graduates are serving in well-known IT organizations in Pakistan, started own successful startups as well as doing freelancing based development through various platforms. The Department furnishes the students with good grip and concepts related to the latest market trends.\n\nEngr. Dr. Abdul Jaleel",
