    "id": "campus-sports",
    "title": "Sports Facilities | UET RCET - University of Engineering and Technology, Gujranwala Campus",
    "href": "https://rcet.uet.edu.pk/campus/sports",
    "originalBody": "Sports\n\nAt UET Rachna Campus, sports play a vital role in the holistic development of students. The campus offers a variety of sports facilities and outdoor spaces designed to cater to the interests of all students, whether they are passionate about competitive sports or simply enjoy staying active. The sports programs provide opportunities for students to engage in team activities, physical fitness, and personal growth. Regular sports events, competitions, and inter-campus tournaments promote teamwork, discipline, and sportsmanship. With a focus on both physical well-being and mental health, the sports facilities encourage students to balance academic pursuits with active lifestyles, fostering a sense of community and camaraderie among the campus population.\n\nCampus Life\nBuildings\nSports\nStudent Societies\nTransportation\nSports\n\nDiscover the sports facilities available to students on campus.\n\nCricket Ground\n\nA large, well-maintained cricket ground equipped with practice nets and floodlights, ideal for day and night matches. The ground is perfect for both casual play and competitive cricket events, offering a dynamic space for cricket enthusiasts.\n\nFootball Field\n\nA spacious football field with excellent turf, providing a great environment for both casual games and competitive matches. The field is designed for day and night play, making it accessible for students at all hours.\n\nBasketball Court\n\nA high-quality outdoor basketball court, offering ample space for individual practice and team games. The court is equipped with professional-grade facilities, ensuring an excellent experience for players of all skill levels.\n\nBadminton Court\n\nAn Indoor badminton court with well-maintained facilities, offering a great space for both practice and competitive matches. The court is designed for comfort and ease of play, catering to enthusiasts of all levels.\n\ngymnasium\n\nA fully-equipped gymnasium providing students with access to state-of-the-art fitness equipment and spaces for physical training. The gym supports a variety of workout routines to help students maintain their fitness and well-being.",
