    "originalBody": "Societies\n\nStudent societies at UET Rachna Campus play a vital role in fostering a vibrant and engaging campus life. These societies provide students with the opportunity to explore their passions, develop leadership skills, and collaborate on various projects outside of their academic curriculum. Whether it's technology, sports, arts, or social causes, the campus offers a diverse range of societies that cater to all interests. Through regular workshops, events, competitions, and community outreach, students can actively participate in initiatives that enrich their personal and professional growth. The societies create a sense of community, allowing students to connect, share ideas, and contribute to the campus environment in meaningful ways.\n\nCampus Life\nBuildings\nSports\nStudent Societies\nTransportation\nStudent Societies\n\nDiscover the student societies that help you connect with like-minded individuals and explore your passions.\n\nInstitute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers-IEEE\n\nThe IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers) is a global organization dedicated to advancing technology for the benefit of humanity. A...\n\nFounded in: 2016\n\nPresident: Abdul Wahab\n\nAdvisor: Engr. Hira Ali Jamal\n\nRead More\nProSoft\n\nProsoft is an official computer science society at UET Lahore RCET campus. we have a talented team always active to organize different events like wor...\n\nFounded in: 2014\n\nPresident: Abdullah Gondal\n\nAdvisor: Dr. Natasha Nigar\n\nRead More\nCultural, Dramatics & Entertainment Society-CDES\n\nThe Cultural, Dramatics, and Entertainment Society at UET RCET Gujranwala is an active student organization dedicated to enhancing the cultural enviro...\n\nFounded in: 2008\n\nPresident: Hassaan Maisum\n\nAdvisor: Mr. Ahmed Ali\n\nRead More\nUET Tribune\n\nUET Tribune is the largest and official media network of the University of Engineering and Technology (UET), Lahore. It serves as a dynamic platform f...\n\nFounded in: 2015\n\nPresident: Ammar Ahmad\n\nAdvisor: Sir Humble Bin Kahlid\n\nRead More\nRachna Sports Society-RSS\n\nThe Rachna Sports Society (RSS) is one of the premier student sports organizations at the University of Engineering and Technology (UET), Lahore, dedi...\n\nFounded in: 2010\n\nPresident: M Shahzaib\n\nAdvisor: Nouman Khalid\n\nRead More\nWomen in Engineering-WIE\n\nWIE (Women in Engineering) is an IEEE initiative focused on empowering women in engineering and technology. It promotes diversity through networking, ...\n\nFounded in: 2017\n\nPresident: Areeba Sarfaraz\n\nAdvisor: Engr. Saira\n\nRead More\nASME RCET Chapter\n\nThe American Society of Mechanical Engineers (ASME) is a professional association that focuses on advancing the field of mechanical engineering. It pr...\n\nFounded in: 2019\n\nPresident: Muhammad Awais Gorchani\n\nAdvisor: Nouman Khalid\n\nRead More\nRachna Community Service-RCS\n\nThe Rachna Community Service (RCS), founded in 2018, is one of the leading student organizations at University of Engineering and Technology (UET), La...\n\nFounded in: 2018\n\nPresident: Muhammad Haffi\n\nAdvisor: Dr. Natasha Nigar\n\nRead More\nUET News\n\nUET News is the official media network society of Rachna College of Engineering and Technology (RCET), operating under the University of Engineering a...\n\nFounded in: 2016\n\nPresident: Rana Behroz Khan\n\nAdvisor: Engineer Humble Bin Khalid\n\nRead More\nJehaad For Zero Thalassemia-JZT\n\nJehaad for Zero Thalassemia (JZT) is a registered organization dedicated to combating thalassemia across Pakistan. With an extensive network of over 1...\n\nFounded in: 2012\n\nPresident: Zohaib Yousaf\n\nAdvisor: Dr. Ali Akber\n\nRead More\nLiterary and Debating Society-LDS\n\nThe Literary and Debating Society (LDS) is a vibrant platform dedicated to nurturing intellectual growth, creative expression, and confident public sp...\n\nFounded in: N/A\n\nPresident: Muhammad Junaid\n\nAdvisor: Mr. Ahmed\n\nRead More",
