    "originalBody": "Transportation\n\nThe campus transportation system at UET Rachna provides convenient access to campus destinations. The system includes buses that run regularly, as well as on-demand services for students and staff. with the opportunity to explore their passions, develop leadership skills, and collaborate on various projects outside of their academic curriculum. Whether it's technology, sports, arts, or social causes, the campus offers a diverse range of societies that cater to all interests. Through regular workshops, events, competitions, and community outreach, students can actively participate in initiatives that enrich their personal and professional growth. The societies create a sense of community, allowing students to connect, share ideas, and contribute to the campus environment in meaningful ways.\n\nCampus Life\nBuildings\nSports\nStudent Societies\nTransportation\nBus Route Schedule\nBus Stop\tArrival Time\tTime Interval\nChanda Qila\t6:45\t0:45\nMall of Gujranwala\t7:35\t0:01\nNADRA\t7:37\t0:01\nSheikhupura Mor\t7:40\t0:01\nSheranwala Bagh\t7:42\t0:02\nSialkoti Gate\t7:43\t0:01\nGondlanwala Adda\t7:45\t0:01\nLarri Adda\t7:48\t0:01\nKFC\t7:50\t0:01\nSharifpura\t7:52\t0:01\nShaheenabad\t7:54\t0:01\nPindi Bypass\t7:56\t0:03\nDC Colony\t8:00\t0:01\nRahwali\t8:05\t0:03\nGhakhar\t8:13\t0:01\nOjla Pull\t8:17\t0:01\nKot Inayat Khan\t8:22\t0:01\nUET Gate\t8:25\t0:00\n\n* Bus schedule is subject to change during holidays and special occasions",
