    "originalBody": "Introduction\nPrograms Offered\nFaculty\nLabs\nPLOs\nPEOs\nLabs\n\nCommunication Lab\n\nEquipment:\nCommunication Trainers (5)\nMicrowave test bench (4)\nTelecommunication Trainer with 7-type of modules (2)\nWorkbenches, each with Power-supply, Signal Generator, Oscilloscope, Multimeter, Breadboard, Components (5)\nComputer (Core i5, 8GB RAM 3.2GHz) (5)\nDigital Storage Oscilloscope (UTD-2025CL 25MHz) (2)\nSpectrum Analyzer (1)\nHackRF one open source SDR Platform (1)\n\nRead More\n\nCircuits and Instrumentation Lab\n\nEquipment:\nWorkbenches, each with Power-supply, Signal Generator, Oscilloscope, Multimeter, Breadboard, Components (08)\nStrain Gauge Trainer (05)\nDigital Oscilloscope (UTD-2025CL 25MHz) (2)\nHydrometer (DT-8860) (05)\nHumidity temperature Meter, Sound level Meter, Tachometer, LCR Bridge, etc (01)\n\nRead More\n\nSemi-Conductor Devices Lab\n\nEquipment:\nWorkbenches, each with Power-supply, Signal Generator, Oscilloscope, Multimeter, Breadboard, Components (10)\n\nRead More\n\nPower Electronics Lab\n\nEquipment:\nPower Electronics Trainer with accessories and modules for single phase and three phase experimentation (IPC) (05)\n\nRead More\n\nPower and Machines Lab\n\nEquipment:\nComputer Assisted Electromechanical Trainer (Lab Volt) – (01)\nAC/DC Motor Generator Trainer (IPC-2100MG) (01)\nCTransformer Trainer Model (IPC 314-T) (01)\nTransformer Trainer (01)\nDistribution Transformer 11KV/400V (01)\nWork Station CD 32inch with core to quad PC system (01)\nDigital LRC Meter UNI-T600 (01)\nEarth Resistance Tester (01)\nWinding Machine (02)\nDigital Wattmeter (04)\nDigital Lux Meter TES 1330-A (01)\n3-Phase Induction Motor (5HP with Spring Load) (01)\nPower Factor measuring meter (02)\nLoad Bank LCR single phase (01)\nDigital Multimeter UT 33A (20)\nResistive Load Banks (01)\nCapacitive Load Banks (01)\nInductive Load Banks (01)\nLaptop DELL XP1640 (01)\nPhase Sequence Indicator (02)\nInduction motor test Bench Frame (01)\nEarth Leakage Circuit Breaker (01)\nPower meter (11)\nTachometer (05)\nVariable AC Regulator 2kva, lkva (01)\nVariable Rheostate (02)\nThree phase Induction motor (02)\nSingle phase Induction motor (01)\nDc motor (04)\nUniversal motor (01)\nTransmission Line Trainers (02)\nRadial & Ring main simulator Module (01)\nFeeder Distribution Scheme Modules (04)\n\nRead More\n\nMicroprocessors Lab\n\nEquipment:\nIntel Architecture Based µ-Controller Trainer (05)\nMicroprocessor Interface Trainer (05)\nGalieo Board (4)\nDigilent Xilinex Universal Programmer (BASYS-3) (2)\nIntel Galileo Board (10)\nUniversal Programmer Super Pro (05)\nTiva C-Series Launchpad (19)\nIntel Core i-5 2.1GHz Processor, 250 GB HDD, 8GB RAM with NVIDIA Quadro K2000 Graphics Card (4)\nRaspberry Pi 3B+ with LCD, Keyboard, Mouse, HDMI cable, 16GB micro card and power cable and T-Cobbler (8)\nWorkbenches: Arduino kit, sensor kit, camera, gyroscope, accelerometer, motor etc (08)\nRobot Smart Car 2 wheel Trainer (05)\nRobot Smart Car 4 wheel Trainer (05)\nDigilent NEXYS A7 FPGA Trainer (1)\n\nRead More\n\nAnalog & Digital Electronics Lab\n\nEquipment:\nDigital Analog Electronics Trainer (05)\nDigital Training Board (10)\nIntegrated Electronics Trainer (05)\nElectronics Circuit Trainer (05)\nVerification of Network Theorem (05)\nPN Junction diode CHAR apparatus (05)\nWorkbenches, each with Power-supply, Signal Generator, Oscilloscope, Multimeter, Breadboard, Components (10)\nAdvanced Digital Trainer (05)\n\nRead More\n\nComputer Lab\n\nEquipment:\nTotal WorkStations = 20\nSpecifications are given below: Operating System=Window 10 Pro 64-bit CPU=Intel Core i5 2500 @3.3GHz Standby Bridge 32nm Technology RAM= 4.00 GB Dual-Channel DDR3 @ 665MHz (9-9-9-24) Motherboard=Lenovo Graphics=L177WSB(1440x900@60Hz) Intel HD Graphics (Lenovo)\nStorage=232 GB Seagate ST3250312AS (SATA)\nOptical Drives=PLDS DVD-RW DH16ABSH Audio=High Definition Audio Device\n\nRead More\n\nControl Systems Lab\n\nEquipment:\nAnalogue and Digital Servo Fundamental Trainer (01)\nModular Servo System Trainer (01)\nPLC Controller (2)\nOptical sensor Transducer Trainer (1)\nTemperature Transducer Trainer (1)\nPressure Transducer Trainer (1)\nComputer (Dual Core) (4)\nDigital Storage Oscilloscope (UTD-2025CL 25MHz) (1)\nOscilloscope MCP-Electronics 100Hz (1)\nPLC Trainer (1)\n\nRead More\n\nPhysics Lab\n\nEquipment:\nBH curve Apparatus (01)\nMelde's Apparatus Vibration Graph (04)\nDielectric Constant Measurement Apparatus (01)\nSextant Apparatus (02)\nMaxwell’s Needle (03)\nCompound Pendulum (03)\nTravelling Microscope (01)\nFlat Spring Apparatus (03)\nSpectrometer for Diffraction Grating (01)\nE/M of an electron (01)\nKind’s Tube Apparatus (01)\nPhoto Cell Apparatus (02)\n\nRead More\n\nProject Lab\n\nEquipment:\nDC power supply (07)\nFunction Generator (02)\nOscilloscope 20MHz (05)\nHeat Gun / sucker (02)\nMultimeter (07)\nPCB Drill Machine and kit (01)\nSoldering Iron (05)\nGlue Gun with Accessories (02)\nPCB Boards (10)\nProject Board (10)\nWire Cutter, Screw Driver, Pliers, Tool kit etc.\n\nRead More",
