    "originalBody": "Introduction\nPrograms Offered\nFaculty\nLabs\nPLOs\nPEOs\nLabs\n\nFluid Mechanics Lab\n\nEquipment:\nHydraulic bench\nImpact of jet\nFlow over weirs\nBernoulli’s theorem\nOrifice discharge\nEnergy losses in bends\nOsborne Reynolds demonstration\nEnergy losses in pipes\nHydrostatic pressure\nFlow visualization in\nDead weight calibrator\nMetacentric height\nSeries parallel pumps\nCentrifugal pump characteristics\nFree and forced vortices\nWater hammer\nPelton wheel\nOrifice and free jet flow\n\nRead More\n\nInternal Combustion Engines Lab\n\nEquipment:\nSingle Cylinder 4 Stroke SI Engine with\nPower Steering (Ball circulation)\nDisc and Drum Brake\nMegaTec Electric Dynamometer/\nMegaTec Electric Dynamometer/\nAuto Trainer Test Stand with S.I Engine\nChassis with Diesel Engine ( Rear Wheel )\nChassis with Petrol Engine (Front Wheel )\nABS Brake Board (Anti Jamming )\nAutomotive Trainer Test Stand\n\nRead More\n\nHeat and Mass Transfer Lab\n\nEquipment:\nHeat Transfer Service Unit\nLinear Heat Conduction\nRadial Heat Conduction\nLaws of Radiant Heat Transfer\nExtended Surface Heat Transfer Unit\nUnsteady State Heat Transfer Unit\nCombined Convection\nThermal Conductivity of Liquids and Gases\nWater to water Turbulent Heat\nErrors in Temperature\n\nRead More\n\nWorkshop\n\nEquipment:\nLathe Machines\nFitting Tables\nCarpentry Tables\nVertical Drill Machines\nHand Drill Machine\nFoundry\nElectric Arc Welding Plant\nGas Welding Plant\nGrinding Machines\nFoundry Table\nDisplay Tables\nClamp Meter (Digital)\nHooter (Alarm)\nSafety Helmets\nGoggles (Welding)\nGoggles (Lathe Machine)\nSafety Shoes\nFire Extinguisher\nWood Planer\nHand Saw\nElectric Wood Cutter\nElectric Wood Planer\nVernier Caliper (Digital)\nVernier Caliper (Analogue)\nBevel Protractor\nMicrometer Gauge\nPliers\nCutting Files\nHand Hacksaw\nHammers\nChisel Kit\nSteel Cupboards\nAnvil\nMilling Machine\nPower Hacksaw\n\nRead More\n\nMechanics of Machines Lab\n\nEquipment:\nBelt Friction Apparatus\nPivot Friction Apparatus\nFlywheel\nSlider Crank Mechanism\nCam & Follower\nGovernor Apparatus\nStatic & Dynamic Balancing\nGyroscope\nScrew Jack\nInclined Plane\nToggle Joint\nSimply Supported Beam\nCaster Camber & King Pin Inclination\nGovernor Apparatus (Old Model)\nJournal Bearing Friction\n\nRead More\n\nRefrigeration and Air Conditioning Lab\n\nEquipment:\nThermo-Electric Heat Pump\nVortex Tube Refrigerator\nHVAC Fault Simulator\nReverse Cycle Refrigeration and Air\nMechanical Heat Pump\nAir Compressor\nParts of Window AC\n\nRead More\n\nMechanics of Materials Lab\n\nEquipment:\nElectrical Resistance Strain Gauge\nCombined Bending & Torsion\nCalibration of Electrical Resistance\nPolariscope\nWhirling of Shaft\nSemi Circular Beam\nQuarter Circular Beam\nTorsion of Bar\nAdvanced Beam Testing\nSimply Supported Beam\nBending of Bars\nCircular Beam\nHooks Law Apparatus\n\nRead More\n\nThermodynamics Lab\n\nEquipment:\nTemperature Measurement\nFlash Point\nCharles Law\nManometer\nBoyle's Law Apparatus\nAnemometer\n4 Stroke Petrol Engine\n2 Stroke Petrol Engine\nViscosity Meter\nStirling Engine\nMini Vacuum Pump\nCalorimeter\n\nRead More\n\nMechanical Vibration Lab\n\nEquipment:\nMass Spring System Apparatus\nSimple Pendulum\nBifilar & Trifler Suspension\nCompound Pendulum\nWhirling of Shaft Apparatus\nVibration Analyzer MVP-2C\nStatic & Dynamic Balancing Apparatus\nFlywheel Apparatus\n\nRead More\n\nCAD Lab\n\nEquipment:\n25 Computers\n\nRead More\n\nEnergy Resources and Utilization Lab\n\nEquipment:\nWind Trainer Junior\nPV Panel Array GT-1000\nSolar PV Technology Panel\nSustainable Conservation Technology Panel\n\nRead More",
